# Regenerable intermediates of the cardata.wiki ingest: cw-specs.json is two
# minutes of tools/cw-ingest.js over the cached CSVs, cw-pass.json is twenty of
# tools/cw-accept.js on top. Thirteen megabytes of git history for something a
# command rebuilds is not worth it; what shipped (cw-batch.json) and what was
# refused (cw-rejects.json) are kept, because those are decisions, not workings.
/data/cw-specs.json
/data/cw-pass.json
